#===============================================================================
#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  SovereignOS Memory Manager
#  File: memory_manager.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the SovereignOS memory manager responsible for:
#      • virtual memory paging
#      • allocation & deallocation
#      • memory pool management
#      • integrity verification
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [Memory Pools](ca://s?q=Explain_Memory_Pools)
#    - [Page Table](ca://s?q=Explain_Page_Table)
#    - [Allocation Engine](ca://s?q=Explain_Allocation_Engine)
#    - [Deallocation](ca://s?q=Explain_Memory_Deallocation)
#    - [Integrity Verification](ca://s?q=Explain_Memory_Integrity_Verification)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - create_pool(name, size, page_size)
#         Creates a memory pool.
#
#    - allocate(pool, bytes_needed)
#         Allocates memory from pool.
#
#    - free(alloc_id)
#         Frees allocated memory.
#
#    - verify(alloc_id)
#         Validates allocation entry.
#
#    - snapshot()
#         Returns memory manager state.
#
#===============================================================================
#  ALLOCATION STRUCTURE FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "id": "ALC-XXXX",
#      "pool": "system",
#      "bytes": 8192,
#      "pages": 2,
#      "timestamp": <epoch>
#    }
#
